        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Dear Nadu,<div><br></div><div>Would you please share the file (if it's about the exports) or a screenshot of what you're seeing so we're on the same page and I can be exact?<br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Mojtaba<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3</a><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, October 14, 2024 at 5:10:50 AM, Nadezhda Barbashova wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Hi team,</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Please help Nadu, Sydney, and Mengsi with their inquiry below:</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">---</span></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">5. </span><b>Metadata Labels</b><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">: We noticed that some of the metadata output contains numeric values for e.g. status and unanswered IDs, which we were unable to identify during the meeting. Could you clarify what labels or information are associated with these numbers?</span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\