        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Hi Sydney,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for the clarification.</div><div><br></div><div>\n<b>answer_id:</b> This metadata is simply the ID of the answers you define for Single Answer and Multiple Answer questions. For other types of questions, it'll be \"null\". We might remove it for other question types in the future.</div><div><br></div><div>\n<b>unanswered_status_id:</b> If a question is unanswered, you can find the reason behind it using this metadata. This is the same as what you see in the responses table on your researcher dashboard. This is how the texts in the responses table map to the status IDs in the exported CSV:</div><div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to unknown reason\" = -1</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Skipped\" = 1</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to question criteria\" = 2</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to section criteria\" = 3</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to question randomization\" = 4</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to section randomization\" = 5</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to disabled question\" = 6</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to zero section loop\" = 7</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to sections flow\" = 8</div>\n<div>- \"Unanswered - Due to session status\" = 9</div>\n</div><div><br></div><div>Also, \"null\" for this metadata means that your question already has a response.</div><div><br></div><div>You can learn more about what these mean at the end of this section: <a href=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/reference/survey/view-responses#activity-responses-page\" title=\"https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/reference/survey/view-responses#activity-responses-page\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://learn.avicennaresearch.com/reference/survey/view-responses#activity-responses-page</a>\n</div><div>We will update our Learn and include the IDs too.</div><div><br></div><div>Please let me know if there's still something unclear.</div><div>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Mojtaba<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3</a><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, October 14, 2024 at 7:48:07 PM, Sydney Fortner wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Hi Mojtaba,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>We are referring to the \"answer id\" and \"unanswered id\"s in the metadata section. Here is a screenshot for clarification.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Sydney</div>\n<div>LEAP Neuro Lab Manager<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Oct 14, 2024 at 12:01 AM Mojtaba Javan &lt;<a href=\"mailto:support@avicennaresearch.com\">support@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\n</div>\n<blockquote><div><div>Dear Nadu,<div> </div>\n<div>Would you please share the file (if it's about the exports) or a screenshot of what you're seeing so we're on the same page and I can be exact?<br><div>\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span>Mojtaba<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25791/afc136dcad6b7aa3</a><br>\n</div>\n<div> <span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span>\n</div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div>\n<div>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@avicennaresearch.com\">support@avicennaresearch.com</a> - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, October 14, 2024 at 5:10:50 AM, Nadezhda Barbashova wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Hi team,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Please help Nadu, Sydney, and Mengsi with their inquiry below:</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:initial;\">---</span></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<span style=\"background-color:initial;\">5. </span><b>Metadata Labels</b><span style=\"background-color:initial;\">: We noticed that some of the metadata output contains numeric values for e.g. status and unanswered IDs, which we were unable to identify during the meeting. Could you clarify what labels or information are associated with these numbers?</span>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Thank you very much,</div>\n<div>Sara</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div>\n<div> </div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n</div></div></blockquote>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<br><br>\n</div>",
